ass=\"abs-zone\">\n        <div class=\"abs-text\">\n          <h3 class=\"sec\">摘要</h3>\n          <div class=\"btn-translate\">🅰 翻译</div>\n          <div class=\"abs-body\">\n            本发明涉及一种容器封口装置，尤其是用盖(10)来封口容器的装置(1)，装置(1)包括将盖(10)施加到容器上的封口锥体(3)和用于将盖(10)转交给封口锥体(3)的接取轮(5)，其中，该接取轮(5)包括至少一个活动部段(52)，该活动部段可由从盖供给机构(4)接取盖(10)的接取位置运动到将盖(10)转交给封口锥体(3)的移交位置。\n          </div>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"abs-fig\">\n          <h3 class=\"sec\">摘要附图</h3>\n          <div class=\"fig placeholder\">[Diagram: 专利摘要附图 — 环形封口机机构俯视图，标注 1、2、3、4、20、30、40、42、46、50，right of abstract]</div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- ================= SIDE ================= -->\n    <div class=\"side-col\">\n\n      <div class=\"side-head\"><span>法律状态</span><span class=\"more\">详细&gt;&gt;</span></div>\n      <div class=\"timeline\">\n        <div>20131030</div>\n        <div>公开</div>\n        <div>20131127</div>\n        <div>实质审查的生效</div>\n        <div>20160622</div>\n        <div>授权</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"side-head\"><span>引证(7)</span><span class=\"more\">详细&gt;&gt;</span></div>\n      <div class=\"link-list\">\n        <div>CN101817492A</div>\n        <div>CN201817250U</div>\n        <div>CN2813578Y</div>\n        <div>CN2861125Y</div>\n        <div>DE1200161B</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"side-head\"><span>同族(4)</span><span class=\"more\">详细&gt;&gt;</span></div>\n      <div class=\"link-list\">\n        <div class=\"clipped\">CN103373680A</div>\n        <div>EP2653435A1</div>\n        <div>DE102012103518A1</div>\n        <div>EP2653435B1</div>\n      </div>\n\n    </div>\n\n  </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
